cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software to preprocess Chronicle Android raw data in a
  publication, please cite it using the metadata below. Cite the exact
  version (and contract version) that processed your data — the version is
  recorded in every run's processing report and provenance sidecar.
type: software
title: Chronicle Android Raw Data Preprocessing App
abstract: >-
  A dual-engine (browser + desktop Python) preprocessing instrument for
  Chronicle Android usage-events data: reconstructs app-usage and
  screen-usage sessions from raw interaction events under an explicit,
  versioned configuration and workflow contracts, with byte-exact cross-engine parity,
  golden-scenario locking, and per-run PROV provenance sidecars. The
  research ontology (LinkML/OWL/SHACL) that defines the instrument's
  measurand and parameters is generated from the same source of truth.
authors:
  - family-names: Alam
    given-names: Uzair
version: 1.0.0
repository-code: https://github.com/uzaira0/chronicle-android-raw-data-preprocessing-app
license-url: https://github.com/uzaira0/chronicle-android-raw-data-preprocessing-app
keywords:
  - Chronicle
  - Android usage data
  - screen time
  - digital media use
  - preprocessing
  - provenance
  - reproducibility
